---
// Static boot flow diagram — zero client JS
---

<section id="architecture" class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="mb-8 font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-2xl font-bold text-terminal-bright sm:text-3xl">
      <span class="text-terminal-green">#</span> How It Works
    </h2>

    <!-- CFC bridge data-flow diagram -->
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-terminal-border bg-terminal-surface p-6">
      <pre class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs leading-relaxed sm:text-sm"><code><span class="text-terminal-dim">┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>  <span class="text-terminal-amber">CFC Bridge — browser automation for Claude Code</span>     <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>                                                      <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>  <span class="text-terminal-cyan">Edge Canary</span> <span class="text-terminal-dim">(debloated, sideloaded extension)</span>     <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       │  <span class="text-terminal-dim">screenshots · navigate · form-fill · CDP</span>   <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       │  <span class="text-terminal-green">▲ WebSocket ▼</span>                            <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       ▼                                              <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>  <span class="text-terminal-green">Bridge server</span> <span class="text-terminal-dim">(claude-chrome-android)</span>           <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       │  <span class="text-terminal-dim">FIFO tool queue · /health · /tool</span>         <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       │  <span class="text-terminal-green">▲ stdio ▼</span>                                <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       ▼                                              <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>  <span class="text-terminal-green">Native host</span> <span class="text-terminal-dim">(Claude Code cli.js)</span>                 <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       │  <span class="text-terminal-green">▲ unix socket ▼</span>                          <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       ▼                                              <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>  <span class="text-terminal-green">MCP relay</span> ──▶ <span class="text-terminal-cyan">tools in any Claude session</span>        <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>       <span class="text-terminal-dim">mcp__cfc-bridge__screenshot, navigate, …</span>      <span class="text-terminal-dim">│</span>
<span class="text-terminal-dim">└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></code></pre>
    </div>

    <!-- Key points -->
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-terminal-border/50 bg-terminal-surface/50 p-4">
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-sm font-medium text-terminal-green">MV2 on Edge Android</h3>
        <p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs text-terminal-dim">
          MV3 service workers never start in sideloaded CDP targets.
          CFC ships as an MV2 background page, pushed via <code>--load-extension</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-terminal-border/50 bg-terminal-surface/50 p-4">
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-sm font-medium text-terminal-amber">Byte-preserving patches</h3>
        <p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs text-terminal-dim">
          Claude Code's bun-compiled binary is patched in place —
          equal-length overwrites keep the vfs offsets intact so it still runs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
